  "scope": "Native managed adoption of an independently approved competing committed account-root replacement.",
  "behavior": [
    "Prepared plans and adopted exact proposals are distinct owner states; adopted history does not fabricate a local plan.",
    "Original non-commit and exact approved retirement are independently authenticated before owner mutation.",
    "Original closure precedes native prospective registry validation; cross-application root reuse is refused before the parent changes.",
    "Parent/journal transition and retained retirement precede registry selection.",
    "Original retry reconciles every partial commit, preserves the original operation and selects revision 2 once.",
    "Current target, credential/policy, witness admission and owner lifetime remain mandatory; historical adoption cannot extend credential validity."
  ],
