  "process_scope": "18 actual new kill-before-return cuts per Debug/current, Debug/minimum and Release/current profile, alongside all 14 alternate-target and 7 initial root cuts. Exact checkpoint bytes and on-disk registry states are checked.",
  "negative_cases": [
    "Changed retirement signature, different approved winner and wrong-purpose receipt substitution are refused.",
    "A target already associated with another application is refused before changing original parent rows; original non-commit may already be durable.",
    "A committed winner with a credential expired at fixture time 170 cannot activate, while the original historical result remains recoverable.",
    "Adopted state has no preparation; preparation-only operations refuse without fabricating one.",
    "Closing the controller revokes the returned successor owner."
